      <div class="project-grid">
        <div class="project-card">
          <div class="project-tag">Full Stack</div>
          <h3>Study Buddy</h3>
          <p>Study companion app with real-time messaging through the Stream API, tutor + tutee matching, and geolocation-based study buddy discovery, built with React, C#, Firebase, Supabase and Stripe API for payment processing.</p>
          <div class="project-links">
            <a href="https://github.com/cs501-s26-magenta/StudyBuddyApp" target="_blank">GitHub</a>
            <a href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/1M3mpXDOjYeYWEsAPxzc6-LB47Uicu_nQ/view?usp=drive_link" target="_blank">Live Demo</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="project-card">
          <div class="project-tag">Research</div>
          <h3>Analyzing Zone Size in ZNS SSDs</h3>
          <p>Research on Zoned Namespace SSDs through the ConfZNS++ emulator using FIO and RocksDB to evaluate how zone size and parallelism affect throughput, latency, and write amplification.</p>
          <div class="project-links">
            <a href="https://github.com/cbmary27/ZNS_AnalyzingZoneSize" target="_blank">GitHub</a>
            <a href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/1oDVbecqa96Dc3RpYUNLqoEiT3pKckxRZ/view?usp=drive_link" target="_blank">Research Paper</a>
            <a href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/1Yq_pwgAsx6siEmEfI5nUJOsVrgWT_H_p/view?usp=drive_link" target="_blank">Award</a>
          </div>
        </div>
