          <div class="project-tag">ML</div>
          <h3>Training CNN Models to adapt to robustness</h3>
          <p>Improving various CNN/transformer robustness to hidden distortions on images in the CIFAR 100 dataset through training/finetuning.</p>
          <div class="project-links">
            <a href="https://github.com/cbmary27/CNN_robustness_training" target="_blank">GitHub</a>
          </div>
